              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami arusia lilaka khu babaandu babaasitaka Danieli bareerwe mala bamwaatwe mwiloo lie chitalang'i. Nibo, babaana babwe, na bakhasi babwe. Ne bakhoola asi khu sibale sie liloo tawe, chitalang'i chaberiekakho chabakaamula ne khutonyaka bikuumba biabwe bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
